tjiptemp (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - TJIP-1 protocol over USB CDC, WiFi (TCP) and BLE.
    - Live plotting, recording with fitted UTC timestamps, backfill over
      redundant links.
    - Calibration wizard for PT1000 (Callendar-Van Dusen), type-K (ITS-90) and
      NTC (Steinhart-Hart / Beta), written to the board's NVS.
    - CSV, Excel, Parquet, JSON and figure export.
    - Local REST and WebSocket API with generated OpenAPI.

 -- raaf <rafaeldiederen@gmail.com>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
